    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so futile to keep trying to \"reconnect\" or \"rebuild\" when the foundation is just gone. everyone looks at me and sees a villain. even in my own head, that's all there is now. it's like i'm just performing a role in a life that doesn't even belong to me anymore, just waiting for the credits to roll. it feels more like a punishment than actually living.",
